  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Collegit ergo in agro usque ad vesperam: et quæ collegerat virga cædens et excutiens, invenit hordei quasi ephi mensuram, id est, tres modios.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quos portans reversa est in civitatem, et ostendit socrui suæ: insuper protulit, et dedit ei de reliquiis cibi sui, quo saturata fuerat.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.19",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dixitque ei socrus sua: Ubi hodie collegisti, et ubi fecisti opus? sit benedictus qui misertus est tui. Indicavitque ei apud quem fuisset operata: et nomen dixit viri, quod Booz vocaretur.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.20",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui respondit Noëmi: Benedictus sit a Domino: quoniam eamdem gratiam, quam præbuerat vivis, servavit et mortuis. Rursumque ait: Propinquus noster est homo.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.21",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ait Ruth: Hoc quoque, inquit, præcepit mihi, ut tamdiu messoribus ejus jungerer, donec omnes segetes meterentur.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.22",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui dixit socrus: Melius est, filia mea, ut cum puellis ejus exeas ad metendum, ne in alieno agro quispiam resistat tibi.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.2.23",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.2.23",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Juncta est itaque puellis Booz: et tamdiu cum eis messuit, donec hordea et triticum in horreis conderentur.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.1",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Postquam autem reversa est ad socrum suam, audivit ab ea: Filia mea, quæram tibi requiem, et providebo ut bene sit tibi.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Booz iste, cujus puellis in agro juncta es, propinquus noster est, et hac nocte aream hordei ventilat.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lavare igitur, et ungere, et induere cultioribus vestimentis, et descende in aream: non te videat homo, donec esum potumque finierit.",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quando autem ierit ad dormiendum, nota locum in quo dormiat: veniesque et discooperies pallium, quo operitur a parte pedum, et projicies te, et ibi jacebis: ipse autem dicet quid agere debeas.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quæ respondit: Quidquid præceperis, faciam.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Descenditque in aream, et fecit omnia quæ sibi imperaverat socrus.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cumque comedisset Booz, et bibisset, et factus esset hilarior, issetque ad dormiendum juxta acervum manipulorum, venit abscondite, et discooperto pallio, a pedibus ejus se projecit.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ecce, nocte jam media expavit homo, et conturbatus est: viditque mulierem jacentem ad pedes suos,",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et ait illi: Quæ es? Illaque respondit: Ego sum Ruth ancilla tua: expande pallium tuum super famulam tuam, quia propinquus es.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ille: Benedicta, inquit, es a Domino, filia, et priorem misericordiam posteriore superasti: quia non est secuta juvenes, pauperes sive divites.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Noli ergo metuere, sed quidquid dixeris mihi, faciam tibi. Scit enim omnis populus, qui habitat intra portas urbis meæ, mulierem te esse virtutis.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec abnuo me propinquum, sed est alius me propinquior.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quiesce hac nocte: et facto mane, si te voluerit propinquitatis jure retinere, bene res acta est: sin autem ille noluerit, ego te absque ulla dubitatione suscipiam, vivit Dominus. Dormi usque mane.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dormivit itaque ad pedes ejus, usque ad noctis abscessum. Surrexit itaque antequam homines se cognoscerent mutuo, et dixit Booz: Cave ne quis noverit quod huc veneris.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et rursum: Expande, inquit, pallium tuum, quo operiris, et tene utraque manu. Qua extendente, et tenente, mensus est sex modios hordei, et posuit super eam. Quæ portans ingressa est civitatem,",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.16",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et venit ad socrum suam. Quæ dixit ei: Quid egisti, filia? Narravitque ei omnia, quæ sibi fecisset homo.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ait: Ecce sex modios hordei dedit mihi, et ait: Nolo vacuam te reverti ad socrum tuam.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.3.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.3.18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dixitque Noëmi: Expecta, filia, donec videamus quem res exitum habeat: neque enim cessabit homo, nisi compleverit quod locutus est.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.1",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ascendit ergo Booz ad portam, et sedit ibi. Cumque vidisset propinquum præterire, de quo prius sermo habitus est, dixit ad eum: Declina paulisper, et sede hic: vocans eum nomine suo. Qui divertit, et sedit.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tollens autem Booz decem viros de senioribus civitatis, dixit ad eos: Sedete hic.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quibus sedentibus, locutus est ad propinquum: Partem agri fratris nostri Elimelech vendet Noëmi, quæ reversa est de regione Moabitide:",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quod audire te volui, et tibi dicere coram cunctis sedentibus, et majoribus natu de populo meo. Si vis possidere jure propinquitatis, eme, et posside: sin autem displicet tibi, hoc ipsum indica mihi, ut sciam quid facere debeam: nullus enim est propinquus, excepto te, qui prior es, et me, qui secundus sum. At ille respondit: Ego agrum emam.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui dixit Booz: Quando emeris agrum de manu mulieris, Ruth quoque Moabitidem, quæ uxor defuncti fuit, debes accipere: ut suscites nomen propinqui tui in hæreditate sua.",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui respondit: Cedo juri propinquitatis: neque enim posteritatem familiæ meæ delere debeo: tu meo utere privilegio, quo me libenter carere profiteor.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth#Ruth.4.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/clementine/ruth",
    "canonical_ref": "Ruth.4.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hic autem erat mos antiquitus in Israël inter propinquos, ut siquando alter alteri suo juri cedebat, ut esset firma concessio, solvebat homo calceamentum suum, et dabat proximo suo: hoc erat testimonium cessionis in Israël.",
    "chunk_index": 69,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      382,
      405
    ],
    "date_confidence": "established",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
